  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onions and cook until they are translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Add the shredded cabbage and cook until it is slightly caramelized.",
    "Add the smoked paprika, sea salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the bhuna sauce and stir to combine.",
    "Add the cooked, diced octopus and stir to combine.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
